                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iW0mXBXmjAD62S0PX"><h3>Built for People Who Take Their Skin Seriously</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iQUNcSVHoEaYe271l"><p>Vellano was founded after our lead engineer watched his daughter&apos;s eczema clear up on a trip abroad, where water is naturally softer. We spent three years perfecting a multi-stage filtration system that brings that same purity to any home showerhead.</p></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text inhXbLhTJybEinqna"><p>Today, over 47,000 households filter their shower water with Vellano. Our cartridges combine KDF-55 media and Vitamin C to remove 99.8% of chlorine, heavy metals, and limescale — independently validated by third-party labs.</p></div
