                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iUr3jOou9xSR2bWSL"><h3>I Tested the Vellano Filter for 30 Days. Here&apos;s What My Dermatologist Said.</h3></div
                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i4mnP3dchjkBsJ9pM"><p>Week one was underwhelming, I&apos;ll admit. But by week two, my hairdresser pointed out my hair felt unusually soft. The post-shower scalp itchiness I&apos;d lived with for years had quietly started to fade.</p></div
