                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iQI9M2hfFdMGhz2JQ"><p>Installation took under two minutes. No tools. No plumber. No lost water pressure. If you have hard city water, this isn&apos;t a luxury — it&apos;s a correction.</p></div
