              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iIWAWqZGXX5shmnt2"><p>How long does installation take?</p></div
              ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iULsCGAugg7TsorWg">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                  <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                </svg></div></button
            ><div class="io1vnEzG88d3WsMHg" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iHAZB9tXxAIBAZocf"><p>Under 5 minutes — and you won&apos;t need any tools. Simply unscrew your current showerhead, hand-tighten the Vellano filter inline between the pipe arm and showerhead, then reattach the head. A step-by-step illustrated guide is included in every kit.</p></div></div
            ></div
          ><div data-state="closed" class="itaOm95fVVyePfxym" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
            ><button class="it9rSoJOTEFtJ1l7K" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iVfpNFceav01ntO8Y"><p>Will it fit my existing showerhead?</p></div
              ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iNgQ5DbBnqJJ1AY0s">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                  <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                </svg></div></button
            ><div class="i63V4E7abfyL18coG" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text itGAp66LrKIjPeOMa"><p>Yes. The Vellano filter uses a universal ½-inch NPT threaded connection that fits 99% of standard showerheads sold in North America, Europe, and Australia. Both fixed-mount and hand-held showerheads are compatible.</p></div></div
            ></div
          ><div data-state="closed" class="id6nm1NTFzomHZlot" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
            ><button class="ixgg4ZU9a0c0DbrTP" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iJoGyayKTKM6cH6bA"><p>How often do I need to replace the filter cartridge?</p></div
              ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="ih3C4UNKknQr2Qk2g">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                  <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                </svg></div></button
            ><div class="ic25ZCQYPO3adjdz4" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iJk3vih0tHRrFK9p2"><p>We recommend replacing your cartridge every 3–6 months, depending on your local water hardness and daily usage. Each cartridge is rated for approximately 50,000 litres (13,000 gallons). The Starter Kit includes 2 cartridges — roughly a full year of supply for most households.</p></div></div
            ></div
          ><div data-state="closed" class="iRDZWzGNtF8TqQIaX" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
