                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                  <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                </svg></div></button
            ><div class="iWyiIR78llP5zpjGp" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iefRS18uOOS9tUtfq"><p>The 15-stage KDF-55 and Vitamin C media targets: free chlorine and chloramine (99.8% removal), heavy metals including lead and mercury, sediment and rust particles, scale-forming calcium and magnesium deposits, and volatile organic compounds (VOCs). It does not strip fluoride or essential beneficial minerals.</p></div></div
            ></div
          ><div data-state="closed" class="iyWkn7J1QQZj9gOgo" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
            ><button class="iEplkLy2SzxqKIxPq" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iSXqnlcCJFmex6yf4"><p>Will it reduce my water pressure?</p></div
              ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iWUVaGmjVYqFAOIyP">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
