                </svg></div></button
            ><div class="igLBnGNp4Xwi0mZ6b" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i6nPLH5Yfp11T3IlH"><p>No. The Vellano filter is engineered with a high-flow media chamber specifically designed to maintain full pressure. The vast majority of customers report no change in pressure — and some even notice a slight improvement after scale buildup from old fittings is cleared.</p></div></div
            ></div
          ><div data-state="closed" class="iVXmYtj44NbqZ8xA5" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
            ><button class="iD93pOA3otoWAXjii" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ixi4tzycAnO6oQlpO"><p>Is the product independently certified or tested?</p></div
              ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="ioGHGNcdaF6YzPBeJ">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                  <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                </svg></div></button
            ><div class="ifIp3k1vDhyySnC5J" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iqHafsFRsnchRK6SG"><p>Yes. The Vellano filter is independently tested to NSF/ANSI Standard 177 for shower filtration performance. All cartridges are manufactured in an ISO-certified facility and undergo batch testing before shipping. Lab reports are available on request.</p></div></div
            ></div
          ><div data-state="closed" class="id3dgr38WZoEjUJJb" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
