              ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="ioYiClHE0yrQ3LgS2">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                  <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                </svg></div></button
            ><div class="ipuk5skqBTyd8OV6g" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iyNVsO5j4iEFihnrq"><p>Every Vellano purchase is covered by a 30-day no-questions-asked return policy on unused filters and a 12-month manufacturer&apos;s warranty against defects. If your filter isn&apos;t performing as expected, our support team will make it right — no hassle, no forms, no waiting.</p></div></div
